    "detailed_description": "<strong>Rings of Eden is an indie open-world RPG </strong> inspired by Souls-like games, that blends fantasy, science-fiction, adventure and satisfying combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679600/extras/4f22d8487934531b7307c7718567ee0f.avif?t=1713459258\" width=700 height=80 /></span><br><br><i>Uncover a labyrinth of secrets, take on enemies, and explore a world where nothing is as it seems.<br><br>Violently ripped from his former life, Jake is forced to adapt and become stronger to survive life on The Ring. He must work with others like him to wield newfound abilities and escape The Ring before it destroys him.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A vibrant yet dangerous world, complete with complex characters<br></li><li> Discover the secrets of The Ring and its origins <br></li><li> Overcome terrifying enemies, building up your skills to master your favourite techniques <br></li><li> Get lost in far-reaching, story driven quests</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679600/extras/725a13b4923e1a2300c2da73f74745c1.avif?t=1713459258\" width=700 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enhanced combat and strategy: Choose skills that suit your playstyle<br></li><li> Character customisation: Customise your look to your taste</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Rings of Eden is an indie open-world RPG </strong> inspired by Souls-like games, that blends fantasy, science-fiction, adventure and satisfying combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679600/extras/4f22d8487934531b7307c7718567ee0f.avif?t=1713459258\" width=700 height=80 /></span><br><br><i>Uncover a labyrinth of secrets, take on enemies, and explore a world where nothing is as it seems.<br><br>Violently ripped from his former life, Jake is forced to adapt and become stronger to survive life on The Ring. He must work with others like him to wield newfound abilities and escape The Ring before it destroys him.</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A vibrant yet dangerous world, complete with complex characters<br></li><li> Discover the secrets of The Ring and its origins <br></li><li> Overcome terrifying enemies, building up your skills to master your favourite techniques <br></li><li> Get lost in far-reaching, story driven quests</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679600/extras/725a13b4923e1a2300c2da73f74745c1.avif?t=1713459258\" width=700 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enhanced combat and strategy: Choose skills that suit your playstyle<br></li><li> Character customisation: Customise your look to your taste</li></ul>",
